<title>USA: Paradigm Technology completes plant sale.</title>
<headline>Paradigm Technology completes plant sale.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paradigm Technology Inc said Tuesday it has completed the previously announced sale of its wafer fabrication facility in San Jose to Orbit Semiconductor, a unit of DII Group Inc.</p>
<p>Paradigm said in a statement it sold the facility for $20 million consisting of $6.6 million in cash, $7.6 million in debt assumption and a short-term note for $5.8 million.</p>
<p>Under terms of the deal Orbit Semiconductor will supply a specified quantity of wafers to Paradigm over the next six months.</p>
</text>
